			"notes": "# Notes\n\n## Updates\n- Full 2.0.0 rewrite for Minecraft version 26.3.\n- Everything is bundled in one command `/loc`, fully explained on the README\n\n## Migration\n- To migrate from any of the 1.x versions, just put the 2.x rewrite in your mods folder, replacing the old one and it will take care of everything.\n\n## Features\n- Fuzzy search for `/loc find <name>` command\n- Teleportation across dimensions\n- Config file with multiple options (location protection, teleportation permission level, waypoint style and more!)\n\n## Bugfixes\n- in version 1.2.0, waypoints were poorly implemented by spawning invisible armor stands. In some cases multiple armor stands would spawn per location causing multiple locations to appear at once. This is now fixed, waypoints do not spawn armor stands and the old ones will be deleted when their chunks are loaded."
		},
